{"id":"kodolaag","name":"Kodolaag","type":"character","aliases":["Kodo","Kodolaag the demon","Kodoldaag"],"description":"A demon performer of the Cult of Rakdos, infatuated with and later husband of Zita.","pages":4,"first_seen":"2019-01-23","last_seen":"2019-01-23","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Kodolaag","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Kodolaag","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Kodolaag\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"grimbly-wothis-e5","era":{"date":"2012-10-05","era":"rtr","label":"Return to Ravnica"},"summary":"Grimbly is imprisoned in Udzec; Jitka visits him and is detained over a planted whiskey bottle while Kodolaag and Olrich pass through.","participants":["grimbly-wothis","jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"wiki/grimbly-wothis","order":1803,"story_date":"","storyline":"Murders at Karlov Manor","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":8,"quote":"Grimbly Wothis was later imprisoned in Udzec, a massive prison facility.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=Grimbly%20Wothis%20was%20later,a%20massive%20prison%20facility.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Grimbly Wothis","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Grimbly_Wothis#:~:text=Grimbly%20Wothis%20was%20later,a%20massive%20prison%20facility.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Grimbly Wothis\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e0","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag goes into Zita's effigy shop, is heckled by an Azorius elocutor outside, and clumsily tries to chat her up.","participants":["kodolaag","zita","azorius-senate"],"location":"derision-s-peak","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":12,"quote":"I'd like to buy these.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27d%20like%20to%20buy%20these.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27d%20like%20to%20buy%20these.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e1","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag finally introduces himself as Kodolaag and learns Zita's rule that effigy spells on Azorius senators are now punishable by imprisonment.","participants":["kodolaag","zita"],"location":"derision-s-peak","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":31,"quote":"New laws in the skies last week. Effigy spells used upon members of the Azorius Senate are punishable by imprisonment.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=New%20laws%20in%20the,are%20punishable%20by%20imprisonment.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=New%20laws%20in%20the,are%20punishable%20by%20imprisonment.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e2","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag uses blight parchment to drive the Azorius elocutor away, and Zita fears arrest.","participants":["kodolaag","blight-parchment","zita"],"location":"derision-s-peak","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"He grabs his head with both hands, screaming at the top of his lungs.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=He%20grabs%20his%20head,top%20of%20his%20lungs.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=He%20grabs%20his%20head,top%20of%20his%20lungs.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e3","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag persuades Olrich to host Zita's effigy sales at the Mockturne by promising him an audience at Rix Maadi.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"the-mockturne","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"I'll call in a favor. I'll get you an audience at Rix Maadi!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27ll%20call%20in%20a,audience%20at%20Rix%20Maadi%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%27ll%20call%20in%20a,audience%20at%20Rix%20Maadi%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e4","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag performs poetry and a comedy set mocking Azorius and Dovin Baan, which falls flat when an arrester appears.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","dovin-baan","azorius-senate"],"location":"the-mockturne","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":71,"quote":"I finish my set anyway—twenty-three minutes of pure torture.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%20finish%20my%20set,minutes%20of%20pure%20torture.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=I%20finish%20my%20set,minutes%20of%20pure%20torture.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e5","era":null,"summary":"On the way home Zita fixes graffiti insulting Dovin Baan, and an Azorius arrester arrests her for defacing a building and slandering a Grand Arbiter, with Kodolaag's statement logged against her.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","dovin-baan","azorius-senate"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":86,"quote":"defacing a public building,\" he continues, \"Plus Azorius code 6342-P, slandering a Grand Arbiter,\" the arrester says, binding Zita up","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=defacing%20a%20public%20building%2C%22,says%2C%20binding%20Zita%20up","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=defacing%20a%20public%20building%2C%22,says%2C%20binding%20Zita%20up","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag and Olrich visit the precognition mage Lucinka, who gives them a box and instructions for freeing Zita.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","lucinka"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":107,"quote":"Visit Udzec tomorrow morning. Get in line behind the minotaur with a curly red mane.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Visit%20Udzec%20tomorrow%20morning.,a%20curly%20red%20mane.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Visit%20Udzec%20tomorrow%20morning.,a%20curly%20red%20mane.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e7","era":null,"summary":"At Udzec, Olrich dresses as a baby and swallows the bloodfray amulet, and Kodolaag frames the minotaur Jitka Wothis by hiding a whiskey bottle in her cape to distract the nullmages.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","jitka-wothis","bloodfray-amulet","udzec"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"Carefully, carefully I rest the bottle inside, hoping it's light enough not to pull the fabric.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Carefully%2C%20carefully%20I%20rest,to%20pull%20the%20fabric.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e8","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag finds Zita under an Azorius spell that makes prisoners praise their imprisonment and realizes everything is not fine.","participants":["kodolaag","zita","udzec"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":139,"quote":"The guards must be forcing the prisoners to speak fondly about their internment—or else.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20guards%20must%20be,about%20their%20internment%E2%80%94or%20else.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20guards%20must%20be,about%20their%20internment%E2%80%94or%20else.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e9","era":null,"summary":"Zita brings a guard's drawing in a coloring book to life, and Kodolaag draws every guard on blight parchment and tears the pages, incapacitating them.","participants":["zita","kodolaag","olrich","blight-parchment"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":148,"quote":"Electric magic ignites the paper, and the guards wail out in unison as if they're being burned alive.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Electric%20magic%20ignites%20the,they%27re%20being%20burned%20alive.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e10","era":null,"summary":"Olrich impersonates Dovin Baan to hold off a soldier, and the trio walks out among exiting visitors.","participants":["olrich","kodolaag","zita","dovin-baan"],"location":"udzec","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":150,"quote":"Citizens! Behold! It is I, your highly esteemed Grand Arbiter, Protector of Justice, Purveyor of Protocols!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Citizens%21%20Behold%21%20It%20is,Justice%2C%20Purveyor%20of%20Protocols%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e11","era":null,"summary":"Jitka Wothis and a vampire identify Kodolaag and Olrich, who are bound by magic; Zita escapes into the crowd.","participants":["jitka-wothis","kodolaag","olrich","zita"],"location":"udzec","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":157,"quote":"Before we can deny it, Olrich and I are bound up in magic.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=Before%20we%20can%20deny,bound%20up%20in%20magic.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e12","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag and Olrich are put to forced labor at the Exner prison site.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","exner"],"location":"exner","importance":"minor","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":159,"quote":"As soon as we're given our uniforms, we're put to work with the rest of the non-violent offenders and pre-offenders.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=As%20soon%20as%20we%27re,non%2Dviolent%20offenders%20and%20pre%2Doffenders.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=As%20soon%20as%20we%27re,non%2Dviolent%20offenders%20and%20pre%2Doffenders.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e13","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag has Olrich cough up the amulet and scales the Exner scaffolding, shattering the bloodfray stone and triggering a massive riot as archons close in.","participants":["kodolaag","olrich","bloodfray-amulet","exner"],"location":"exner","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":172,"quote":"The amulet cracks and unleashes a swarm of black tendrils, pressing the light back and turning day to night.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20amulet%20cracks%20and,turning%20day%20to%20night.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Illusions of Child's Play","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-01-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20amulet%20cracks%20and,turning%20day%20to%20night.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Illusions of Child's Play\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Jan 2019."}},{"id":"illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23-e14","era":null,"summary":"Kodolaag joins the riot, and thousands of prisoners escape.","participants":["kodolaag","exner"],"location":"exner","importance":"major","page":"stories/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23","order":677,"story_date":"2019-01-23","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":173,"quote":"The madness spreads.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/illusions-childs-play-2019-01-23#:~:text=The%20madness%20spreads.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wi